249
00:53:49.396 --> 00:53:50.765
Oh, my God.

250
00:53:50.798 --> 00:53:52.667
Okay. You go.

251
00:53:52.700 --> 00:53:54.301
No, you first.

252
00:53:54.334 --> 00:53:56.003
Okay, scaredy-cat.

253
00:54:00.340 --> 00:54:01.475
